{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあるお仕事だったんですが\n早く皆さんにお知らせできたらな～♪\nと思います٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日とても充実していて楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でもね、今日の朝は\nレッスンシューズを探すことよりも\nスイカを切ることを優先してしまったので\n明日の朝は、気を引き締めて\nちゃんと早く起きてスイカを切ろうと思います！٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あごもだしてるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事の間の時間で\n伊織と映画に行きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約束してた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界から猫が消えたなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を観てきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになるから詳しくは言えないけど\nとても感動しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣に伊織がいたから恥ずかしくて\n思いっきりは泣けなかったけど\n静かに泣きました(╥ω╥`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもいいお話でした！\nなんだろう、いろいろ考えが浮かんできて\n映画を観ながら\n私も家族を思い出したり\n語り合える仲間を思い出したり\n大切な皆さんを思い出したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画を観ながら私にとっての\n大切なものをいろいろ考えて\nそれが頭の中に浮かんでいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、映画って素敵！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えることって大変で\n疲れちゃうし嫌なこともあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えることってとても大切なことだし\n考えなくなってしまったら\nきっと人としての成長やいろいろなことが\n終わってしまいそうだなと思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画の予告がたくさんながれて\nみたい映画がたくさんありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、映画みたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹とズートピアを観に行く約束もしてるし\nはやくまた映画みにいこう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あごつかみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あごもだしてるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/26/8867569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあごだしてる写真ばかり、。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ！ヒナセレやらなきゃ！\nいいかげん握手会の服載せろや！\nって感じですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーーい！"}],"source":"archive"}